    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Greeting and sign-off",
     "texto": [
      "In a formal letter you start with **Kære** + the name with title: **Kære hr. Nielsen** (Dear Mr Nielsen). You sign off with **Med venlig hilsen** (with kind regards).",
      "With someone you know, you can write **Kære Louise**. For the sign-off in an informal email: **Hilsen** or **Knus**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A complaint",
     "texto": [
      "Start by explaining why you're writing: **Jeg skriver for at klage over …** = I'm writing to complain about…",
      "Then describe the problem with specific details and ask for a solution: **Jeg vil gerne have pengene tilbage.** = I would like my money back."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
